          "bg": "#fff7ed",
          "previewHtml": "<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-orange-50 rounded-lg border border-orange-200\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-orange-100 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-orange-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 8V4m0 0h4M4 4l5 5m11-1V4m0 0h-4m4 0l-5 5M4 16v4m0 0h4m-4 0l5-5m11 5l-5-5m5 5v-4m0 4h-4\"></path></svg></div><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-orange-800\">Seleksi Multi Node</p><p class=\"text-xs text-orange-600\">Shift+Klik atau rubber band</p></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Buat Group",
          "desc": "Klik kanan pada area canvas (dengan node terpilih). Pilih \"Group X nodes\". Sebuah group container akan dibuat membungkus semua node terpilih.\nPerhatikan bahwa edge otomatis di-route ke boundary group. Group memiliki label default yang bisa di-rename.",
          "color": "#ec4899",
          "bg": "#fdf2f8",
          "previewHtml": "<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-pink-50 rounded-lg border border-pink-200\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-pink-100 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-pink-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10\"></path></svg></div><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-pink-800\">Buat Group</p><p class=\"text-xs text-pink-600\">Group X nodes</p></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Rename Group",
          "desc": "Klik kanan pada group. Pilih \"Rename Group\". Beri nama: \"Kelompok Kondisi Utama\". Klik \"Save\". Label group akan berubah.",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": "<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg border border-indigo-200\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-indigo-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M15.232 5.232l3.536 3.536m-2.036-5.036a2.5 2.5 0 113.536 3.536L6.5 21.036H3v-3.572L16.732 3.732z\"></path></svg></div><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-800\">Rename Group</p><p class=\"text-xs text-indigo-600\">Klik kanan → Rename Group</p></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Tambah Node ke Dalam Group",
          "desc": "Buat node kondisi baru. Untuk memindahkannya ke dalam group:\n• Seleksi node baru\n• Klik kanan → \"Move to Group\"\n• Pilih group \"Kelompok Kondisi Utama\"\nNode akan masuk ke dalam group. Edge yang terhubung ke node tersebut akan ikut routing ke boundary group.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": "<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg border border-blue-200\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-blue-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M8 7h12m0 0l-4-4m4 4l-4 4m0 6H4m0 0l4 4m-4-4l4-4\"></path></svg></div><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-blue-800\">Move to Group</p><p class=\"text-xs text-blue-600\">Pindahkan node ke dalam group</p></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 6,
          "title": "Stack Vertically",
          "desc": "Klik kanan group → \"Stack Vertically\". Semua node di dalam group akan dirapikan secara vertikal. Berguna setelah menambah banyak node ke dalam group.",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": "<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-teal-50 rounded-lg border border-teal-200\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-teal-100 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-teal-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 7v10l8 4V11L4 7zm16 0l-8 4v10l8-4V7zm0 0l-8-4-8 4\"></path></svg></div><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-teal-800\">Stack Vertically</p><p class=\"text-xs text-teal-600\">Rapikan node vertikal</p></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 7,
          "title": "Ubah Warna Group",
          "desc": "Klik kanan group → \"Change Color\". Pilih warna preset (merah, biru, hijau, dll.) atau klik \"Random\" untuk warna acak. Warna group membantu identifikasi visual kelompok logika yang berbeda.",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": "<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-violet-50 rounded-lg border border-violet-200\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-violet-100 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-violet-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M7 21a4 4 0 01-4-4V5a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v12a4 4 0 01-4 4zm0 0h12a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2.343M11 7.343l1.657-1.657a2 2 0 012.828 0l2.829 2.829a2 2 0 010 2.828l-8.486 8.485M7 17h.01\"></path></svg></div><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-violet-800\">Ubah Warna</p><p class=\"text-xs text-violet-600\">Preset atau random</p></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 8,
          "title": "Copy Group",
          "desc": "Klik group untuk memilihnya. Tekan Ctrl+C (copy), lalu Ctrl+V (paste). Seluruh group beserta node di dalamnya akan di-duplikat. Group baru bisa dipindahkan dan diedit secara independen.",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": "<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-amber-50 rounded-lg border border-amber-200\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z\"></path></svg></div><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-amber-800\">Copy Group</p><p class=\"text-xs text-amber-600\">Ctrl+C, Ctrl+V</p></div></div>"
        },
